WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.319
Omri, good morning! How are you?
I spoke to you yesterday morning:
I have a cow with mastitis.

00:00:05.319 --> 00:00:13.080
I saw your post and thought:
let’s give it a try.
Maybe you’re right — at least this once.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.199
I want to show you the results
of using Garliboost.
Mastitis. Cow No. 325.

00:00:19.199 --> 00:00:26.720
This cow normally produces
about 50–60 liters of milk a day.
But yesterday she produced only 20 liters.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:33.719
The day before, milk yield fell to 37 liters.
In the morning, the milk conductivity
reading was 12. I want to show you…

00:00:33.719 --> 00:00:42.280
…the chart. Look at the results
of using Garliboost.
Remember, this cow normally produces
50–60 liters a day.

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:47.600
The day before yesterday it was 37 liters,
and yesterday, 20 liters.
Look at the milk conductivity
readings.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:53.039
Here are the morning and afternoon readings.
You see — after just the second
administration, it dropped…

00:00:53.039 --> 00:00:57.840
…to 10.
I’ll show you on the chart.

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:03.656
Look how the reading dropped,
and then feed intake
began to recover.
It really is impressive.
